# Cloudflare Pages headers. Agent-facing alternates (RFC 8288) and cache safety for markdown negotiation.
/
  Link: </sitemap-index.xml>; rel="sitemap", </index.md>; rel="alternate"; type="text/markdown", </llms.txt>; rel="alternate"; type="text/plain"
  Vary: Accept
/pricing
  Link: </pricing.md>; rel="alternate"; type="text/markdown"
  Vary: Accept
/download
  Link: </download.md>; rel="alternate"; type="text/markdown"
  Vary: Accept
/compare
  Link: </compare.md>; rel="alternate"; type="text/markdown"
  Vary: Accept
/.well-known/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=3600
